abstract:
  REDCap Automated Billing is an automated, data-driven
  service billing system for a REDCap system. The University
  of Florida's CTS-IT designed and wrote this system to charge
  a modest annual fee for each project and bill for customer
  support work logged in a REDCap-based service request
  system. This generates revenue, reduces data privacy risks
  by incentivizing the deletion of abandoned projects, and
  improves the quality of research productivity metrics.
